#               Scalar" + §"The Observer Principle" (the σ(x) +
#               observer-as-part-of-model formalization; subjects
#               contribute to BOTH T_μν AND σ);
#               shards/eigenboard.mirror (three-altitude lift docblock;
#               every @reality/subject possesses an eigenboard whose
#               inference_basis drives the subject's non-linear
#               trajectory);
#               shards/subject.mirror (family-root; SEL v1.1
#               licensable-party carrier; @reality/subject inherits
